Z||000000||Gokart||08-12-99||07:15 PM||||The cops in between the town I live in and my work can probably here me comin'when I have my stereo half way and have been itchin' to pull me over and thought they finally had a reason yesterday! They made complete asses out of themselves! When I saw the lights in my mirror I checked my speed and I just happened to be going 5 miles below the speed limit. After promptly pulling over, I told the nice officer I know I wasn't speeding. He informed me that speeding wasn't the issue, it was my tinted windows. He asked me if they were factory and I told him yes and that they are NOT EVEN TINTED! He had his tint gauger in his hand and he couldn't figure out how to use them on the "quarter windows"! Then he looked in the car and noticed that they weren't even in the car and just an outside design, he handed me back my license and said "you're all set"! HA HA HA! GOKART-1 COPS-0!
